Build notes:
  The SLKBUILD builds from source using the system Go toolchain.
  Go 1.25.0+ is required (per go.mod).
  Go modules are downloaded during the build.
  Both barnard and the native Go barnard-ui are installed.

Required libraries:
  openal, opus, opusfile, and rnnoise

Optional notification and UI helpers:
  openssl, magic-wormhole, sox, socat, speech-dispatcher, espeak-ng,
  and libnotify

Upgrade notes:
  Users of the old barnard-ui should remove
  ~/.config/barnard/servers.conf before starting the new UI.

  To adopt the new default keybindings, remove the keybinding entries
  from ~/.barnard.toml. Leave them in place to retain existing bindings.

  Copy /usr/share/barnard/barnard-sound.sh to a user-writable location
  before customizing it, then point notifycommand in ~/.barnard.toml to
  that copy.
